Oratcl for Windows

The windows build is available as a separate download file from sourceforge.

There are 2 files necessary for oratcl to operate on windows.

they are : oratcl41.dll pkgIndex.tcl

oratcl41.dll needs to be in your tcl\lib

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl41.dll

the 3 tcl files need to be in tcl\lib\oratcl4.1

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl4.1\pkgIndex.tcl
